Package: bwcsv
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets
Description: Lightweight desktop application for viewing CSV files
 bwCSV displays comma-separated value files in a searchable table and lets users
 select delimiters and table headers.
